{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792668780,"nonce":"uvEX9oGWAOVtkcWmMdKmryHvwvg=","title":"Reserved `_`-prefixed orgs are not reserved. `/v1/secrets` can list/overwrite/delete secrets in org `_plugin_connections` (plugin connection credentials, ADR-0072 d3) and `_forge` (forge App keys) — global admin only, values stay write-only, so the impact is an audit bypass, not a leak. Also nothing stops `bind_repo` (crates/scarab-server/src/lib.rs ~8785) binding a repo owner literally named `_plugin_connections`/`_forge`, whose Project would then inherit those secrets (blocked in practice by forge naming rules + unguessable keys), nor a plugin install into such an org.","message":"Fix: refuse `_`-prefixed orgs in /v1/secrets, bind_repo and plugin install; test each.\nFound by the d3 red team (afk run 20261022-0116, review-d3-security.md F6; judge-d3.md).","files":null}]}